2026-11-10T02:23:26Z"}],"body":"# HyperFrames v0.9.28\n\nReleased on 2026-11-10.\n\nA piped render now reports how its motion blur went. Short clips from Apple-encoded videos keep their last frame.\n\n## Features\n\n- **CLI:** A piped render's `@hf-result` line now carries the motion blur outcome (tier, movers, failed frames), so a host app can report it ([651de1d94](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/651de1d948b0f619001e3705cba98fa415baf0dd), [#7468](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7468)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Engine:** Short clips from Apple-encoded videos keep their last frame ([4d0fa2baa](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4d0fa2baa85d821a8b13c04225138480e02ebe1d), [#7469](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7469)).\n- **Share:** Preserve re-invites and validate workspace responses ([58e9cae75](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/58e9cae7520c057914249fc60477421727b4386f), [#7470](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7470)).\n- **Player:** Unload the video when its src is cleared ([e5e79e59e](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e5e79e59ea63f92696fda39e18b89467d554d0d4), [#7466](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7466)).\n\n## Docs & Examples\n\n- **Studio App:** Cloud exports come with the plan, not only an API key ([756bd6b17](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/756bd6b174dea149b08011012c1e530017d08299), [#7441](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7441)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.9.27...v0.9.28\n"}
